---
import Layout from "../layouts/layout.astro";

export const prerender = true;

const lastUpdated = "July 2025";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service"
  description="Backthred's terms of service — the rules and conditions for using our platform."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-360 px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <!-- Header -->
      <div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-4xl">
          Terms of Service
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-sm mt-10 max-w-none text-muted-foreground [&_h2]:mt-10 [&_h2]:mb-3 [&_h2]:text-base [&_h2]:font-semibold [&_h2]:text-foreground [&_p]:mb-4 [&_p]:leading-relaxed [&_ul]:mb-4 [&_ul]:flex [&_ul]:flex-col [&_ul]:gap-2 [&_li]:pl-4 [&_li]:relative [&_li]:before:absolute [&_li]:before:left-0 [&_li]:before:content-['–']">

        <p>
          Welcome to Backthred. By accessing or using our website and services,
          you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. Please read them
          carefully before placing an order or creating an account.
        </p>

        <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By creating an account, browsing our site, or placing an order, you
          confirm that you are at least 18 years of age (or have the consent of
          a parent or guardian) and that you agree to these Terms of Service and
          our Privacy Policy.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Account Registration</h2>
        <p>
          To place an order, you must create an account. You are responsible for
          maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials and for all
          activity that occurs under your account. Notify us immediately at{" "}
          <a href="mailto:hello@backthred.com.gh" class="text-primary underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-primary/80">
            hello@backthred.com.gh
          </a>{" "}
          if you suspect unauthorised access.
        </p>

        <h2>3. Products and Pricing</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            We make every effort to display accurate product descriptions and
            pricing. However, errors may occur. We reserve the right to correct
            errors and cancel orders placed at incorrect prices.
          </li>
          <li>
            All prices are listed in Ghanaian Cedi (GHC) and are inclusive of
            applicable taxes unless stated otherwise.
          </li>
          <li>
            Product availability is not guaranteed. We reserve the right to
            limit quantities or discontinue products without notice.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>4. Ordering and Payment</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            Placing an order constitutes an offer to purchase. We reserve the
            right to accept or decline any order.
          </li>
          <li>
            Payment is required at the time of ordering via Mobile Money (MTN
            MoMo, Telecel Cash, or AirtelTigo Money).
          </li>
          <li>
            You will receive an order confirmation in your account once payment
            is successfully processed.
          </li>
          <li>
            We are not responsible for delays or failures resulting from Mobile
            Money network issues outside our control.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>5. Delivery</h2>
        <p>
          Delivery timelines are estimates and are not guaranteed. We are not
          liable for delays caused by circumstances beyond our reasonable
          control, including but not limited to public holidays, extreme weather,
          or carrier issues. For full details see our{" "}
          <a href="/shipping-and-delivery" class="text-primary underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-primary/80">
            Shipping & Delivery
          </a>{" "}
          page.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Returns and Refunds</h2>
        <p>
          Returns and exchanges are subject to our{" "}
          <a href="/returns-and-exchanges" class="text-primary underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-primary/80">
            Returns & Exchanges Policy
          </a>.
          Refunds are issued to the original Mobile Money number used at
          checkout, within 3–5 business days of return approval.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Prohibited Use</h2>
        <p>You agree not to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            Use the site for any unlawful purpose or in violation of any
            applicable law.
          </li>
          <li>
            Attempt to gain unauthorised access to any part of the platform or
            other users' accounts.
          </li>
          <li>
            Engage in fraudulent activities, including placing orders with
            no intent to pay.
          </li>
          <li>
            Reproduce, duplicate, copy or resell any part of our site without
            express written permission.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>8. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>
          All content on this website — including logos, images, text and
          software — is the property of Backthred Ghana or its content providers
          and is protected by applicable intellectual property laws. You may not
          reproduce or use our content without prior written consent.
        </p>

        <h2>9. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the fullest extent permitted by law, Backthred Ghana shall not be
          liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential or punitive
          damages arising from your use of our services or products. Our total
          liability for any claim shall not exceed the amount you paid for the
          specific order giving rise to the claim.
        </p>

        <h2>10. Changes to These Terms</h2>
        <p>
          We may update these Terms of Service at any time. Changes take effect
          immediately upon posting. Continued use of our services after changes
          are posted constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.
        </p>

        <h2>11. Governing Law</h2>
        <p>
          These Terms of Service are governed by and construed in accordance with
          the laws of the Republic of Ghana. Any disputes shall be subject to the
          exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of Ghana.
        </p>

        <h2>12. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          For questions about these Terms, contact us:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Email: <a href="mailto:hello@backthred.com.gh" class="text-primary underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-primary/80">hello@backthred.com.gh</a></li>
          <li>Phone: +233 24 000 0000</li>
          <li>Address: Accra Digital Centre, Circle, Accra, Ghana</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
